Not recommended.
1. UN is Clark's most comfortable series, but this one is too bad.
Addition: Today, I compared these inks with the previous UN series insoles (I kept the insoles even though I threw away the shoes). The quality of the material has significantly declined; they are less elastic and less breathable than before. The “softness” they claim to have is actually just a fake illusion.
2. My instep is not particularly high; the part that is causing discomfort is located about 3 centimeters forward from the highest point of my instep.
