Size, Logistics
The quality of the products is okay, but the logistics are really slow. In the past, all our shoes were shipped via DHL. This time with Apex… We bought quite a few UA products domestically, and the prices weren’t low at all. It feels like UA has a higher status or quality compared to Nike and Adidas, right?
