Size: I am 176 cm tall and weigh 68 kg. My shoulders are of average width, so I usually wear size 180 for clothes. The garment I bought is size M; the hem is a bit long, but otherwise it fits perfectly. I saw some recommendations for size S – does that mean the person’s figure is really that slim? Or do people prefer clothes that fit more tightly? I think hoodies should be a bit looser in fit.
Therefore, it is rated three stars because this was bought for my first love in life and we have been together for almost three years until last year when he left me forever.
So three stars because this is what I bought for my first love in life; I don’t know how far it will go, maybe I’ll throw it away!
We had been together for almost three years when she left me last year. Even now, whenever I think of her, it feels so painful that I want to leave this world. She was the first woman in my life, and she brought me shadows and heartache that have lasted a lifetime; to this day, I still haven’t been able to overcome it.
When I bought this phone, I thought about the two feelings I had at that time: the desire to share both the good times and the bad times together. But now, those moments are simply unbearable to recall. Perhaps life is just like that—there are some people we never want to meet in our lives, and there are some things we never want to know. But what can we do about it?
How many times has it happened that whenever I see a Samsung phone, her image comes to mind immediately, and a sense of pain overcomes me? I’ve never been willing to spend more than 2,000 yuan on a phone for myself. However, when I bought one for her, I didn’t hesitate for a second. No matter how good you are to someone, one day, if they change their heart, all the promises and vows vanish like smoke.
Pick-up service needs improvement.
I bought five vouchers for pick-up; when I went to collect them, I was first scheduled to receive three but only two were sent over. After multiple communications, it was confirmed that they had been mistakenly issued and promised to be replenished later. The second time I made an appointment, coincidentally on a holiday, there was no reminder from either the website or WeChat about needing to make an appointment during working hours, causing unnecessary panic. It is recommended that this issue be improved in the future.
