Even after a night, the room with the air conditioner still maintains a very high temperature.
Amazon claimed there were 320 great discounts for the anniversary event, but later I realized that prices like 249, 289, and 299 were available for those products too. It instantly felt like I’d been cheated. However, when I compared the prices with those of various cheaper brands at the supermarket, Amazon’s products were still much more cost-effective. From now on, I can just carry them with me when I go out.
I was not very satisfied with this purchase.
This is the second time I have bought Pampers diapers from Amazon; I had one box of them when my baby was two months old and chose European-imported paper diapers. My first experience with this product was quite satisfactory; my baby used just one diaper all night long, which indeed met their needs for 12 hours without needing to change it.
But this time for L-size diapers, there were two packages in each box with separate packaging; after opening them, it felt that the paper was looser than imported Pampers, and although I used it on my baby, it still worked well without any leakage or rash signs.
But by the time we used the second pack of diapers, red rashes appeared on the inner sides of the baby’s thighs immediately after using them, and they haven’t gone away yet.
I doubt that the quality of the 2 packages in the box is different.
I don’t think I’ll continue making purchases in the future!
Suspected to be counterfeit or of poor quality; please conduct a thorough review by Amazon.
